# This project's claims are digests over exact bytes: fixture hashes, payload
# hashes, registration hashes, per-line provenance verifiable with sha256sum.
# Line-ending translation silently changes those bytes, so a Windows checkout
# would compute different digests for identical content and every freeze check
# would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the freeze.
#
# Nothing in this repository is translated.
* -text
